### AETHERIA — UPGRADE V3

### The Ultimate Blender, 3D Asset, Animation & World-Building Expansion Plan

I want to change the approach completely.

This time, we are not reviewing what is wrong with Aetheria as a game, rewriting its existing systems, or redesigning its established lore.

We are focusing on what we can ADD to make Aetheria substantially better.

The priority is Blender.

I want Upgrade V3 to become a comprehensive expansion of the game's entire 3D production pipeline: character creation, modelling, sculpting, topology, materials, textures, rigging, animation, creatures, environments, procedural generation, visual effects, optimisation and exporting into Unity.

We should approach Blender as the foundation of Aetheria's visual production pipeline.

The goal is to create an asset-production system that allows a very small development team to produce an enormous amount of visually consistent, high-quality content without manually rebuilding everything from scratch.

I would organise this around one central principle:

Create once, reuse intelligently, customise extensively, and make every asset production-ready.

