### 10\. What I would build first

My strongest recommendation is to resist spending the first month building 15 procedural generators.

Build the production infrastructure first.

### My V3 starting priorities

Recommended first five projects

* Aetheria Studio add-on

    The central interface, configuration, asset IDs, logging and module architecture.

* Automated asset validator

    Find broken meshes, UVs, materials, rigs, naming and export problems.

* Character and creature templates

    Standardise the foundation of all future character and monster production.

* Universal export pipeline

    Consistent, repeatable and validated delivery into Unity.

* Geometry Nodes library

    Begin building reusable environmental and procedural tools.

I would measure success by how much repetitive work these systems eliminate, how reliably they produce game-ready assets, and how easily another artist could use them.

